        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. An employee is not entitled to more than twelve (12) weeks of family/medical leave (combined) in a twelve (12) month period. For this purpose, a rolling twelve (12) month period will be used, measured backward from the date the leave is used.",
